    title: "swift: a generic type PARAMETER (T, C, Downstream, Base) and a dotted NESTED project type (MemoryStorage.Backend 59 + DiskStorage.Backend 58 on Kingfisher) fill the module slot that INV-kotob reserves for external types"  # 7d26
